    "turn_text": "Well, I will tell you, we are starting to put the pieces together. As you know, last week we went to Treasury and went through three big binders of suspicious activity reports, bank activity by the Bidens. You saw Chairman Comer come out and say, oh, was it just a couple of Bidens? It's a whole bunch of Bidens. And we haven't even gotten to the bottom of it yet. And so we're trying to connect the dots. And one of the things that that's now leading to is, of course, these are suspicious activity reports that the banks have to send to the treasury. But what they don't often show is what accounts they're coming, what accounts the money's coming from, or what accounts the money's going to. We know some of the individuals, but there's a whole lot more. So we don't know who in some cases or in many cases, what country, what company, what individual is sending money to the Bidens. We see a little bit of the disbursements, but we also don't know what they're spending it on. And for sure, what we have no idea about is why companies, countries, or individuals, especially foreigners, are paying the bidets. What service is Hunter Biden or any of these enterprise providing. Now, we have whistleblowers coming out, FBI, and from the IRS, who are upset with this, what looks to me like obstruction of justice. That's what it looks like to me, tampering with the investigation to make sure that certain privileged people in America don't see the scrutiny of the law that every single one of us. She's keeping in mind, Betty, the president just asked for and got 87,000 new IRS agents. That's not claims people to determine how much money they owe you and how fast they're going to get back to you. Those are people that are going to visit your doorstep and say, huh, looks like you paid the gardener $300 extra dollars. I think, you know, we're going to haul you to jail. for tax evasion. Those are those people. At the very same time, it looks like there was a concerted coordinated effort to make sure that Hunter Biden avoided all that activity. And of course, look, we've seen this before. The crimes bad enough, but the cover up is always worse than the crime. And so this is starting to unravel as we peel back pieces of this story little by little. And look, they're going to fight every single step of the way. So it's going to take subpoenas. We're going to have to drag people in. under protest and we're going to have to get their story for I have to put all this together and see where this leads and of course as you know Benny look no one can say that the president did anything wrong at this moment but we can say there's a lot of smoke regarding the president his family and oftentimes where there's smoke there's something creating that smoke and that's the fire and that's where we're headed right now.",
