    "turn_idx": 69,
    "turn_text": "Well, if he's broken the law, absolutely. I don't know clearly section and code, right? To me, flouting the law, not failing to faithfully execute the law is an impeachable offense. And I would just submit to you that President Biden's inaction and flouting of the law on our southern border is an impeachable offense. Unfortunately, there's not enough of my colleagues that are convinced of that. But I believe that he's already committed not crimes of omission, correction co-mission, but crimes of omission. Just have to convince enough colleagues that the destruction of America by millions upon millions of people coming here illegally by the drugs that are coming, the cartel activity, the time commit and crime that goes with it. is a reason for a vote of no confidence which is essentially impeachment of the President of the United States and others including Secretary Mayorkas and many federal judges.",
