rrectly. and that you can't touch me. And it's a beautiful thing to have. It's the greatest confidence in the world. Don't ever forget your confidence. God, family, country, organize your life right and you'll be set. It's your boy Benny. We'll be back tomorrow. This has been the Benny Show. See ya.",
